<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθυ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθυοειδής</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>PA</u>
			697b5
		</span></i>, al. Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					536a9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>full of fish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.109
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				41.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄδ-ωδα</span>) <i>fishy, smelling</i> or
				<i>tasting of fish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				26.7
			</span></i>.</div>
